 **The log contradicts itself.** Line 78 still says the before/after measurement was \"Not done\", while lines 80–95 report it. That stale line should be removed or marked as superseded.\n\n**What a new attempt should do**\n- Show a gain in `recalculateTextStyles` and in total open time. That means more runs with a noise estimate, or a quieter environment.\n- Or, if the string keys really do push cost elsewhere, measure where it goes and switch to a cheaper key that is still collision-safe, for example a fast non-cryptographic hash that also compares the bytes.\n- Explain the `StyleCache.remove` drop.\n- Clean up the stale \"Not done\" entry.\n\nVERDICT: REJECT recalculateTextStyles and total open time did not drop (124.8→175.5 ms, 2063→2327 ms busy), so the goal isn't met; the StyleCache.remove fall to ~0 needs an explanation; the stale \"Not done\" log line must be fixed","ttft_ms":2226,"type":"result","duration_ms":19725,"uuid":"815764a5-953c-44de-b0bb-a64d236c6486","ttft_stream_ms":1088,"time_to_request_ms":293,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":5,"system_prompt":177,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":3,"input_attachments":17,"input_hooks":2,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":22,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":6,"init_frame_send":3,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":3,"message_prep":0,"model_config_wait":1,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":10,"query_setup":3,"auto_mode_context_wait":6,"model_gates":0,"tool_schema_build":21,"message_normalization":2,"client_creation":2,"request_build":7},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":37,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":152,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":212,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":139,"process_rss_mib_result":221,"process_anon_mib_result":134,"process_peak_rss_mib":255,"process_cpu_ms_turn":944,"process_wall_ms_turn":19725,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":426,"process_wall_ms_streaming":16569,"main_stream_count":4,"main_stream_even